@startuml
title US-006 - Choose plan before registering - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  Submitting the organization/admin form itself (POST /organizations) is
  documented in US-001; this diagram stops at the hand-off between the two.
end note

Admin -> UI: Open the register-org link
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /plans
activate API
API --> UI: 200 OK (PlanDto[])
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Render plan options
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Pick a plan and continue
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Show the organization/admin form, planId carried in the URL
deactivate UI
@enduml
